add('<b>Main result.</b> The validation-selected QQQ hybrid returned <b>204.45%</b>, versus QQQ <b>191.86%</b> and SPY <b>154.91%</b>, net of strategy trading costs from May 1, 2020 to September 30, 2025. With 20bps costs and a one-session delay it returned <b>198.57%</b>. Every headline result below uses the same frozen WRDS/CRSP data. These are developed historical strategies; no untouched holdout or statistically significant alpha is claimed.')
add('1. Data and stock-selection method','Section')
add('Original notebook: 28 total cells; 20 code cells executed without errors on prepared inputs. The redundant raw-preprocessing cell was skipped. This research variant replaces the financial-ratio signal with six prior-price features after an issuer-link audit found a future-listing-dependent missingness channel. WRDS CRSP annual CIZ2025 supplies daily total returns, permanent security identifiers, dated S&amp;P 500 membership and terminal-event records. The sample contains <b>705 historical stock PERMNOs, 41 decision quarters and 20,675 stock-quarter cases</b>.')
add("<b>Preparation filter counts.</b> Point-in-time preparation excludes 110 of 815 exported stock PERMNOs that never belong at the 41 decisions. Among 27,643 positive-close, active-status stock-quarter candidates, membership removes 6,969 non-member rows and keeps 20,674. INFO's one no-start-quote member case is retained separately, giving 20,675 total cases.",'Small')
add('<b>Features:</b> past momentum over 21, 63, 126 and 252 trading days (about 1, 3, 6 and 12 months), measured as log total-return growth; 63-day annualized volatility; and 126-day drawdown. Inputs use only sessions before the decision. Training-only medians and missing flags preserve incomplete rows. Financial statements, identifiers and future listing status are excluded; return labels are training targets, never predictor features.')
add('<b>Learning targets:</b> a label is the realized stock return from one quarterly rebalance close to the next. Benchmark-relative models learn log(1 + stock return) minus log(1 + SPY or QQQ return) over those same dates. The absolute-target diagnostic learns stock return alone in log form. All three targets use identical stocks, features and time splits.')
add('<b>Training and validation:</b> before each forecast, learn from earlier history and compare model errors on three completed quarters within a four-quarter validation span. The latest quarter ends on the forecast date, so its not-yet-observed closing outcome is excluded. Exclude training labels that overlap validation and outcomes unavailable at the applicable cutoff. Choose RF, XGB or LightGBM using lowest past validation MSE, then predict the next holding period.')
add('<b>Implementation:</b> each target has 22 forecast dates. At each date, fit 11 RF seeds plus one XGB and one LightGBM: 286 estimators total. Average the 11 RF forecasts (seeds 42 and 0-9). All models use 200 trees; RF depth 6/minimum leaf 20, XGB depth 3/lr 0.05, LightGBM 15 leaves/lr 0.05. QQQ validation winners: RF 15, XGB 6, LightGBM 1.','Small')
add('<b>Portfolio:</b> quarterly top ceil(5% of eligible members), 26 stocks, equal weighted. The main strategy holds 80% QQQ and 20% actively selected stocks; the SPY hybrid substitutes SPY and its own forecasts. Pure portfolios allocate 100% to actively selected stocks. Candidates remain historical S&amp;P 500 members, not a Nasdaq-100 roster. Hybrids hold the ETF before June 1; pure portfolios hold zero-yield cash until that first forecast.')
